# 🚗 Car Sales Data Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing a **Car Sales dataset** to identify important trends and insights related to car sales, customers, dealers, pricing, and vehicle characteristics.

The analysis was performed using **Python, Pandas, SQL, and Data Visualization techniques** to understand sales patterns and support data-driven business decisions.

---

## 📊 Dataset Information

* **Total Records:** 23,906
* **Total Columns:** 16
* **Domain:** Automobile / Car Sales
* **Data Type:** Customer, Vehicle, Dealer & Sales Data

### 🔹 Main Columns

| Column          | Description                      |
| --------------- | -------------------------------- |
| `Car_id`        | Unique ID of the car transaction |
| `Date`          | Date of the sale                 |
| `Customer Name` | Customer name                    |
| `Gender`        | Customer gender                  |
| `Annual Income` | Customer annual income           |
| `Dealer_Name`   | Name of the dealer               |
| `Company`       | Car manufacturer/company         |
| `Model`         | Car model                        |
| `Engine`        | Engine type                      |
| `Transmission`  | Automatic or Manual              |
| `Color`         | Car color                        |
| `Price ($)`     | Selling price of the car         |
| `Dealer_No`     | Dealer identification number     |
| `Body Style`    | Type of vehicle body             |
| `Phone`         | Customer contact number          |
| `Dealer_Region` | Dealer's region                  |

